[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3228375673","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109656#issuecomment-3228375673","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109656","id":3228375673,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AbRp5","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-27T14:10:58Z","updated_at":"2025-08-27T14:10:58Z","body":"This PR doesn't have quite the right approach I'd prefer on the long run.\r\n\r\n- The final solution shouldn't involve the DEBUG_ENABLED macro. Debug editor builds should be able to generate release templates perfectly fine, and this solution completely breaks the debug editor being able to use the shader baker with a release template. Even if the command is not passed, the hash itself will always be different from a DEBUG_ENABLED build or not.\r\n- We don't want to avoid smolv compression under DEBUG_ENABLED, we only need to disable it if we're generating debug information explicitly with the command. A lot of us always work only under debug builds and avoiding such a core functionality for it to only be possible in release is not good.\r\n- Embedding the debug information in the hash is completely fine, but it shouldn't be based conditionally on the DEBUG ENABLED macro. It should always be there and be based on whether the command line option was passed.\r\n- The one caveat to this solution I propose is that shader baking should explicitly fail if the command line option was passed or we should make this an argument to the shader hash instead as well as the shader container so the shader baker can work regardless.\r\n\r\nIf this seems like out of scope of what you originally wanted to do, let me know and I can tackle it on a PR instead. But as it is, the solution breaks more than I'd like and I don't think it can be merged as is, especially with DEBUG_ENABLED basically breaking the shader baker.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3228375673/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3228437244","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109656#issuecomment-3228437244","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109656","id":3228437244,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Abgr8","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-27T14:28:09Z","updated_at":"2025-08-27T14:28:09Z","body":"I'll do a PR in a bit to showcase the approach we can take with this instead.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3228437244/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3243605329","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109656#issuecomment-3243605329","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109656","id":3243605329,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BVX1R","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"Us